  "body": "Signs fzt-picker.exe, fzt_picker_hook.dll, fzt_picker_frontend.dll, fzt-picker-frontend.exe and test-trigger.exe before upload. Pull requests run it too.\n\nPart of https://openproject.romaine.life/wp/HOMECFG-89, after TMUX-30 (https://openproject.romaine.life/wp/TMUX-30): Defender quarantined an unsigned tmux build as Program:Win32/Contebrew.A!ml and passed the same bytes signed. Same step as tmux-windows-fork#32, signtool /fd SHA256 with the PFX from the repo secrets AT_TERMINAL_PFX and AT_TERMINAL_PFX_PASSWORD (from romaine-kv).",
